	(text "Decoupling per DS11189 Fig. 24: 100nF on each of the 13 VDD pins + 4.7uF; 100nF on\nVDDUSB; VDDA and VREF+ (tied, fed through FB101) 1uF + 100nF each; VCAP1/VCAP2\n2.2uF (ESR < 2 ohm). Place each 100nF at its pin. VDD12DSI/VCAPDSI: no cap (DSI unused)."
