	(text "HSE 8MHz (PLL -> 180MHz). Load caps C = 2*(CL - Cstray): for a CL = 10pF crystal\nand ~4pF stray, 12pF. LSE 32.768kHz: pick a low-CL (6-7pF) crystal the LSE\noscillator drives reliably (ST AN2867); 6.8pF shown for CL = 6pF. Verify both\nagainst the chosen crystals."
